See AGENTS.md for the full project context. This rule extends it for Cursor.

## Project
Mather: iPadOS SwiftUI math app, personal use, Swift 6, iOS 18+, XcodeGen.
Do not edit `.xcodeproj` — edit `project.yml` and suggest running `xcodegen generate`.

## Architecture
- `@Observable` + `@MainActor` everywhere — no TCA, no Combine, no `@Published`
- State in `VerticalSliceEngine`; views are pure; mutations via engine methods
- `SliceStateMachine` owns stage transitions (concrete→pictorial→abstract→transfer→done)

## Tests
- Unit tests: Swift Testing (`@Test`, `#expect`, structs not XCTestCase)
- UI tests: XCTest + XCUIApplication in `Tests/MatherUITests/`
